**Momentum** is the right bucket. It bound DA on 20 of the last 25 days and RT on 29 of the last 45. Direction is south-to-north through Omaha (OPPD), carried by zone 1, under the Cooper–Fairport outage.

But tomorrow only half the driver is there. `analyze_constraint_by_zone` (zone 1, corrected fundamentals) is unambiguous:

